WEBVTT

00:00:01.356 --> 00:00:03.356
Step 1: Start from a clean public browser session

00:00:02.845 --> 00:00:04.845
Step 2: Click the Log in link in the site navigation to reach the Auth0 account chooser

00:00:04.808 --> 00:00:07.998
Step 3: Click the testuser@auth0.local account button to sign in without entering credentials

00:00:07.998 --> 00:00:10.022
Step 4: Click 'Add workspace' to open the New workspace dialog

00:00:10.022 --> 00:00:12.022
Step 5: Type a workspace name into the 'Workspace name' field

00:00:10.742 --> 00:00:13.331
Step 6: Click 'Create workspace' to commit the new workspace

00:00:13.331 --> 00:00:13.585
Step 7: Verify the session ended cleanly with no uncaught console errors or failed network requests during the create-workspace flow
